flowchart TD
  D[Draft Contract Change Record] --> V[Catalog/schema/source validation]
  V --> K{Classification}
  K -->|New / Compatible| PC[Provider + affected Consumer]
  K -->|Conditional| PCA[Provider + all Consumers + Architecture]
  K -->|Breaking| ALL[Provider + all Consumers + Platform if shared + Architecture]
  K -->|Shared primitive| SHARE[Platform Messaging + all affected modules + Architecture]
  PC --> CI[Snapshots, tests, G03 guard, LayerGuard, CI]
  PCA --> CI
  ALL --> MIG[Parallel-version migration record]
  SHARE --> CI
  MIG --> CI
  CI -->|pass and evidence recorded| STATE[Lifecycle transition]
  CI -->|fail| D

